  data: {
    LLM: "In the large-hand deals (13-10), bid conservatively. The penalty for overbidding is much harsher than the reward for overtricks.\n\nUse 'Blooper' leads. If you have the Big Blooper, lead it early to smoke out the opponents' trump Aces or the Little Blooper.\n\nThe 'One-Card Hand' (Suicide): When you only have one card, the bidding is pure luck unless you hold a Joker or the Ace of Trumps. Use it as a moment to calibrate your team's overall risk profile.",
    Player: "In the large-hand deals (13-10), bid conservatively. The penalty for overbidding is much harsher than the reward for overtricks.\n\nUse 'Blooper' leads. If you have the Big Blooper, lead it early to smoke out the opponents' trump Aces or the Little Blooper.\n\nThe 'One-Card Hand' (Suicide): When you only have one card, the bidding is pure luck unless you hold a Joker or the Ace of Trumps. Use it as a moment to calibrate your team's overall risk profile.",
